"banner":"TOTALWAR.webp"}],"lore":"Vanessa brims with energy and positivity. She has a rare aptitude for time magic.\nWhen she was young, she snuck into the Windringer family home's underground vault and activated a sealed time spell, triggering a time magic accident.\nShe was stuck wandering various timelines from the far past to the far future until her father brought her back to the current timeline.\nHowever, in her 15 year absence from the current timeline, her body had not aged one bit. She uses magic to appear a similar age to that her friends Rachel and Eileene.\nUpon her return, Vanessa was hunted by shadows from the Abyss for causing a twist in the timeline.\nWith Yeonhee's help, she became one of the Dimension Keepers tasked with managing the myriad of timelines and dimensions. Now, she travels from dimension to dimension trying to fix the timelines that have gone awry."}